<task id="218b" project="customer-provisioning-orchestration-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>H6 imports the one SpaarkeMaster package — managed by default, unmanaged on explicit instruction (intake solutionPackageType, recorded on the registry row); verifier checks ismanaged; type switch and downgrade refused; DAG H9 ← H6; the 9-solution catalog and Deploy-DataverseSolutions.ps1 retire</title>
    <phase>Model 1 dedicated-stamp remediation — plan §7 T218 (D7, D8, G11); notes/t218-plan.md design 1, 4, 5</phase>
